<x-public-layout title="Terms of use">
    <h1>DahonMD terms of use</h1>
    <p>Effective date: October 7, 2026</p>
    <p>DahonMD provides banana-leaf screening and an optional agriculturist review. An AI result is a screening result, not a confirmed diagnosis. Consult a local agriculture professional before making treatment decisions.</p>
    <p>You can scan on your phone without an account. If you create an account, your saved scans and photos can be synchronized to the server for history and any review you request. Keep your account credentials private and submit only photos you have permission to use.</p>
    <p>Research photo contribution is a separate, optional choice. If you choose it, future account scans may be considered for a research dataset after an agriculturist reviews them. An approved photo may be kept as a private research copy after its scan is deleted. You can turn off future sharing and withdraw current consent in your account settings.</p>
    <p>Read the <a href="{{ route('privacy') }}">privacy policy</a> for data handling, deletion and contact information.</p>
